{"qid": "76265631", "kind": "insufficient_context", "language": "python", "title": "ChromaDb add single document, only if it doesn't exist", "answer": "You can use the `add_document` method of the `Chroma` class to add a single document to the vector store. This method will check if the document already exists in the vector store before adding it. If the document does not exist, it will get the embeddings for the document and add it to the vector store.\n\nHere is an example of how you can use this method:\n\n```python\nfrom langchain.vectorstores import Chroma\n\n# Initialize the Chroma vector store\ndb = Chroma.from_documents([], embeddings, persist_directory='db')\n\n# Add a single document to the vector store\ndocument = {'page_content': 'This is a test document', 'metadata': {'source': 'langchain'}}\ndb.add_document(document)\n```\n\nThis will check if the document already exists in the vector store, and if it does not exist, it will get the embeddings for the document and add it to the vector store.\n\nIf you want to check if a document exists before adding it, you can use the `document_exists` method of the `Chroma` class.\n\n```python\nfrom langchain.vectorstores import Chroma\n\n# Initialize the Chroma vector store\ndb = Chroma.from_documents([], embeddings, persist_directory='db')\n\n# Check if a document exists\ndocument = {'page_content': 'This is a test document', 'metadata': {'source': 'langchain'}}\nif not db.document_exists(document['page_content'], document['metadata']['source'])\n    db.add_document(document)\n```\n\nThis will check if the document already exists in the vector store, and if it does not exist, it will get the embeddings for the document and add it to the vector store.\n\nI hope this helps you with your task.\n", "valid_output": true, "insufficient_information": false, "retrieved": ["llama_index/docs/docs/understanding/storing/storing.md_0_4924", "langchain/docs/docs/how_to/indexing.ipynb_0_7842", "langchain/docs/docs/how_to/vectorstores.mdx_0_5549", "langchain/libs/partners/chroma/langchain_chroma/vectorstores.py_4107_13535", "langchainjs/docs/core_docs/docs/integrations/vectorstores/chroma.ipynb_0_6875", "langchain/docs/docs/integrations/vectorstores/chroma.ipynb_0_6483"], "n_candidates": 62, "cited_doc_ids": ["langchain/docs/docs/how_to/indexing.ipynb_0_7842", "langchain/docs/docs/how_to/vectorstores.mdx_0_5549", "langchain/libs/partners/chroma/langchain_chroma/vectorstores.py_4107_13535", "langchainjs/docs/core_docs/docs/integrations/vectorstores/chroma.ipynb_0_6875", "langchain/docs/docs/integrations/vectorstores/chroma.ipynb_0_6483"], "invalid_citations": [], "repaired_citations": [["llama_index/docs/docs/how_to/indexing.ipynb_0_7842", "langchain/docs/docs/how_to/indexing.ipynb_0_7842"]], "generation_s": 82.28576850000536, "prompt_tokens": 3439, "output_tokens": 509, "config": {"tokenizer": "word_stem", "top_k": 6, "max_chars": 2000, "max_tokens": 800, "prompt": "c745ef277954", "answer_rules": 4, "assistant_llm": {"model": "llama3.2:3b", "digest": "a80c4f17acd55265feec403c7aef86be0c25983ab279d83f3bcd3abbcb5b8b72", "num_ctx": 8192, "temperature": 0.0, "seed": 42}, "context_version": 1, "sample": {"limit": 20, "seed": 42}}}
